<h1>Speex Samples (based on version 1.2-beta1)</h1>
<p> Samples coded with Speex have been decoded back to wav format so you don't need to have a Speex decoder to listen to them</p>
<h2>Narrowband</h2>
<p>These samples are coded using narrowband Speex mode (more bit-rates available)</p>

<h3>Male</h3>

<ul>
	<li><a href="audio/male.wav">original</a></li>
	<li><a href="audio/male_speex_4.wav">coded 4 kbps</a></li>
	<li><a href="audio/male_speex_4_vbr.wav">coded 4 kbps VBR</a></li>
	<li><a href="audio/male_speex_6.wav">coded 6 kbps</a></li>
	<li><a href="audio/male_speex_8.wav">coded 8 kbps</a></li>
	<li><a href="audio/male_speex_8_vbr.wav">coded 8 kbps VBR</a></li>
	<li><a href="audio/male_speex_11.wav">coded 11 kbps</a></li>
	<li><a href="audio/male_speex_15.wav">coded 15 kbps</a></li>
</ul>


<h3>Female</h3>

